          "tz": -360
        },
        "subject": "LU-15834 idl: reserve MDS_RESYNC_SIZE op bias",
        "message": "LU-15834 idl: reserve MDS_RESYNC_SIZE op bias\n\nReserve MDS_RESYNC_SIZE at 1 << 28 in mds_op_bias, and name rs_size\nthe rr_size field of mdt_rec_resync that it marks valid, so an\nin-place mirror extend can tell the MDT the file size.  Only the\nbias, the field name and the wire checks are added here so the value\ncan land before the feature patch.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I4b70caa0c27114154598292106a7ccc4c33ebbe5\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
